<h3>CRITICAL (1)</h3>
<article class="finding">
<h4><span class="sev sev-critical">CRITICAL</span> <span class="new">NEW</span> .env file exposed &lt;img src=x onerror=alert(1)&gt;</h4>
<div class="where">https://a.test/.env</div>
<p class="muted">Check <code>leak-dotenv</code> · confidence high</p>
<ul class="evidence">
<li>Request: <code>GET /.env</code> → 200</li>
<li>Evidence: <code>DB_PASSWORD=…</code></li>
<li>Secret (masked): <code>DB_PASSWORD=hu•••••</code></li>
</ul>
<p>Anyone can read the database password.</p>
<div class="fix"><strong>Fix</strong><pre>Delete the file:

    rm .env</pre></div>
<ul class="evidence">
<li><a href="https://owasp.org/www-project-top-ten/" rel="noopener noreferrer">https://owasp.org/www-project-top-ten/</a></li>
<li>javascript:alert(2)</li>
</ul>
</article>
<h3>HIGH (1)</h3>
<article class="finding">
<h4><span class="sev sev-high">HIGH</span> <span class="new">NEW</span> gallery 1.5: 2 known vulnerabilities</h4>
<div class="where">https://a.test/wp-content/plugins/gallery/</div>
<p class="muted">Check <code>vuln-plugin-gallery</code> · confidence high</p>
<table>
<thead><tr><th>Severity</th><th>CVE</th><th>Advisory</th><th>Fixed in</th></tr></thead>
<tbody>
<tr><td>medium</td><td>CVE-2025-1</td><td><a href="https://www.cve.org/CVERecord?id=CVE-2025-1" rel="noopener noreferrer">Stored XSS</a></td><td>1.5.1</td></tr>
<tr><td>high</td><td>CVE-2026-2</td><td><span class="new">NEW</span> SQL injection &lt;b&gt;bold&lt;/b&gt; <strong>actively exploited</strong></td><td>1.6</td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<p class="muted">Data: WPVulnerability</p>
<div class="fix"><strong>Fix</strong><pre>Update gallery to 1.6 or later.</pre></div>
</article>
